message: "If you use HYWE in your design research or projects, please cite it as follows."
authors:
- family-names: "Subbaiah"
  given-names: "Vikram"
title: "HYWE: Computational Spatial Design Environment"
abstract: "A computational spatial design environment powered by deterministic design computation and edge-native WebAssembly. HYWE generates and explores architectural spatial configurations from relational graphs, rules, and constraints."
url: "https://github.com/vykrum/Hywe"
